## Priority Levels

- **P0 - Critical**: Blocking production deployment or critical security issues
- **P1 - High**: Major functionality, significant technical debt
- **P2 - Medium**: Standard features, moderate improvements
- **P3 - Low**: Nice-to-have, minor improvements

